<title>SWITZERLAND: RESEARCH ALERT-SocGen boosts Clariant EPS outlook.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-SocGen boosts Clariant EPS outlook.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale said it raised its 1997 earnings per share estimate for Clariant to 47.8 Swiss francs from 38.5 to reflect the fact that the July 1 merger with Hoechst speciality chemicals will be backdated to January 1.</p>
<p>It left its 1998 and 1999 estimates unchanged, as well as its neutral rating for shares, it said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
